{
  "name": "Invoice Backup - Gmail to Google Drive",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What this workflow does\n\nPolls Gmail every 5 minutes for UNREAD emails with attachments\nwhose subject contains invoice keywords. For each PDF attachment:\n\n1. Finds (or creates) a monthly folder inside \"Invoice Backups\"\n2. Uploads the PDF there\n3. Labels the email \"Invoice Backup\" and marks it read\n\n**New concepts vs. the weather examples:**\n- Polling trigger with a Gmail search query (`q`)\n- Binary data handling (attachments)\n- Auto-creating folders (with a real Google API call)\n- Credentials: Google OAuth2 (Gmail + Drive)\n- Parallel branches re-joined with a Merge node",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "note-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-340, -340]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "event": "messageReceived",
        "simple": false,
        "maxResults": 10,
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        },
        "filters": {
          "readStatus": "unread",
          "q": "has:attachment subject:(invoice OR factura)"
        }
      },
      "id": "gmail-trigger",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_NAME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Input: one item per email from the Gmail Trigger (attachments downloaded).\n// Each email has metadata in `json` and binary attachments as\n// `attachment_0`, `attachment_1`, ...\n//\n// We keep ONLY PDF attachments and create ONE output item per PDF,\n// so each file can be uploaded separately.\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst results = [];\n\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const json = item.json;\n  const binary = item.binary || {};\n\n  const pdfKeys = Object.keys(binary).filter((key) => {\n    const b = binary[key];\n    const isPdfMime = b && b.mimeType === 'application/pdf';\n    const isPdfName = b && b.fileName && b.fileName.toLowerCase().endsWith('.pdf');\n    return isPdfMime || isPdfName;\n  });\n\n  if (pdfKeys.length === 0) continue; // no PDFs -> this email is ignored\n\n  const emailDate = json.date ? new Date(json.date) : new Date();\n  const monthFolderName =\n    emailDate.getFullYear() + '-' + String(emailDate.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');\n\n  const from = typeof json.from === 'object' ? json.from.text : json.from;\n\n  for (const key of pdfKeys) {\n    results.push({\n      json: {\n        messageId: json.id,\n        subject: json.subject || '(no subject)',\n        from: from || '',\n        fileName: binary[key].fileName || 'attachment.pdf',\n        monthFolderName,\n      },\n      binary: {\n        data: binary[key],\n      },\n    });\n  }\n}\n\nreturn results;"
      },
      "id": "code-prepare",
      "name": "Prepare PDF Attachments",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [260, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "binaryToJson",
        "setAllData": false,
        "sourceKey": "data",
        "destinationKey": "attachmentData"
      },
      "id": "move-binary-hold",
      "name": "Carry Binary as JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.moveBinaryData",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [520, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://www.googleapis.com/drive/v3/files",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "googleDriveOAuth2Api",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "specifyQuery": "keypair",
        "queryParameters": [
          {
            "name": "q",
            "value": "=name = '{{ $json.monthFolderName }}' and mimeType = 'application/vnd.google-apps.folder' and trashed = false"
          },
          {
            "name": "fields",
            "value": "files(id,name)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "id": "http-find-folder",
      "name": "Find Month Folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [520, 260],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "REPLACE_WITH_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_NAME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [],
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.files.length }}",
              "operation": "gt",
              "value2": 0
            }
          ],
          "boolean": [],
          "dateTime": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-folder-exists",
      "name": "Month Folder Exists?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [780, 260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "folder",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "={{ $('Prepare PDF Attachments').first().json.monthFolderName }}",
        "driveId": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_BACKUPS_FOLDER_URL"
        }
      },
      "id": "drive-create-folder",
      "name": "Create Month Folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [780, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "REPLACE_WITH_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_NAME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByPosition"
      },
      "id": "merge-folder-id",
      "name": "Combine Folder ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1040, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "jsonToBinary",
        "convertAllData": false,
        "sourceKey": "attachmentData",
        "destinationKey": "data",
        "options": {
          "dataIsBase64": true
        }
      },
      "id": "move-binary-restore",
      "name": "Restore Binary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.moveBinaryData",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1300, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "file",
        "operation": "upload",
        "inputDataFieldName": "data",
        "name": "={{ $json.fileName }}",
        "driveId": {
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.files ? $json.files[0].id : $json.id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "drive-upload",
      "name": "Upload Invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1560, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "REPLACE_WITH_DRIVE_CREDENTIAL_NAME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "addLabels",
        "messageId": "={{ $json.messageId }}",
        "labelIds": [
          "REPLACE_WITH_LABEL_ID"
        ]
      },
      "id": "gmail-label",
      "name": "Add Invoice Backup Label",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1820, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_NAME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "markAsRead",
        "messageId": "={{ $json.messageId }}"
      },
      "id": "gmail-read",
      "name": "Mark as Read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [2080, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "REPLACE_WITH_GMAIL_CREDENTIAL_NAME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Why a raw HTTP call for the folder lookup?\n\nThe dedicated \"Search\" node returns NOTHING when a folder is missing,\nand an empty output silently ends the branch - so \"create if missing\"\nwould never run. The raw Drive API always returns an item\n(`{ files: [...] }`), so the IF node can branch on it.\n\n## Why \"Carry Binary as JSON\"?\n\nMost nodes build NEW items (HTTP, Drive) and DROP binary attachments.\nMoveBinaryData stores the file as a base64 string in JSON, which\nsurvives those nodes. The Merge re-joins the original data with the\nfolder ID, and \"Restore Binary\" turns it back into a real file.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "note-folder-magic",
      "name": "How the Folder Magic Works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [520, 620]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Gmail Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare PDF Attachments",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare PDF Attachments": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Carry Binary as JSON",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Carry Binary as JSON": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Combine Folder ID",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Find Month Folder",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Find Month Folder": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Month Folder Exists?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Month Folder Exists?": {
      "main": [
